### =========================================================
### PaymentService — http://localhost:7200
### Requiere un JWT emitido por el e-commerce (POST http://localhost:7100/api/auth/login).
### =========================================================

@pay = http://localhost:7200
@shop = http://localhost:7100

### 0. Obtener un token desde el e-commerce
# @name login
POST {{shop}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@sistema.com", "password": "Admin123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Pago menor a 100000 ARS -> Approved
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "amount": 45000 }

### 2. Mismo orderId otra vez -> devuelve el MISMO pago (idempotencia, no cobra dos veces)
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "amount": 45000 }

### 3. Monto >= 100000 -> Rejected
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "amount": 150000 }

### 4. Moneda distinta de ARS -> Rejected
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "amount": 10, "currency": "USD" }

### 5. Monto inválido -> 400 (FluentValidation)
POST {{pay}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444", "amount": -5 }

### 6. Consultar el pago de una orden
GET {{pay}}/api/payments/order/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Listar todos los pagos
GET {{pay}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Sin token -> 401
GET {{pay}}/api/payments
